    <briefdescription>
<para>Class for handling anisotropic 3D Gaussian distributions. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Each dimension can have its own sigma. Precomputed inverse squared sigmas are used for speed. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
